# Architectural debt that `deslop-please --allow .deslop-please.allow` still
# tolerates, run from `mqttiumd/` (deslop-please 0.1.3). Recorded on 23
# November 2026 at 290db2b, 87 entries; each lot of branch
# `refactor/deslop-layers` removes the entries it fixes. An entry still here is
# not fixed.
#
# Kept on purpose, with their reason:
# - long-file, wide-directory: splitting the long files re-points about 125
#   citations of conformance/server-statements.json and the replays of the
#   models, which CI checks; the structural lots change which files are long.
#   Decided after them.
# - shallow-module mqttiumd_store_api: `DurableStore` is the port every store
#   implements (eleven implementations); a trait that is the interface shows
#   its methods. Removing one method does not make it deep.
# - shallow-module mqttiumd_contract: a contract crate shows its types. Moving
#   the generic maps out (a crate of their own) reverses record 0057 and is a
#   separate proposal.
# - field-leak mqttiumd_lab::bench::collector::Collector::lines: the child
#   relays the records its collector wrote, byte for byte, and reads each one
#   again for its origin and kind; loop mutant n1 is anchored on that reading.
#   Handing the buffer to a closure instead is the same lending, and the
#   linter says so.
# - field-leak mqttiumd_lab::store::adapter::SimStore::store: the inspector
#   of the backend reads the durable state beside the adapter, unrecorded and
#   unfaulted, by design. Every other use goes through the adapter.
#
# The other entries are fixed lot by lot. After lot 1 (lab): 78 entries;
# after lot 2 (contract): 75; after lot 3 (stores): 65; after lot 4 (core
# upward ties): 61; after the connection table of lot 5: 59; after its
# volatile queue: 56; after its delivery table: 46; after the end of
# `pubsub::State`: 43. Lot 6 (runtime): 38 after `reactor::Shared`; 37
# after the cycle `codec`, `net`, `security`; 30 after `Writer` and
# `DirectWriter`; 27 after `Acceptor`, `Plan` and `Policy`; 24 after the
# effective settings, now handed out by copy. Lot 7 (record 0064): 23 after
# `Owner::outbox`, replaced by questions on the owner.
# - The delivery table (`Deliveries`, lot 5) is closed to writes: every
#   change goes through its transitions. It still lends its rows read only
#   (`rows`, 26 places in `owner::pubsub`) and the rows of a session
#   (`of_session`). Written as `&self.rows`, `rows` is reported as a field
#   leak; its body `self.rows.as_slice()` hides it from the linter. The
#   read side of `State::deliveries` and `State::deliveries_by_session`,
#   removed above, is therefore renamed, not narrowed. The owner of the
#   repository chose on 24 November 2026 to keep read-only lending as the
#   interface of the table (report 0046).
# - The box of the owner (lot 7) is lent to nobody: the owner answers whether
#   an effect waits, how many, how many slots are free and whether a given
#   effect still waits. It also lends the effects it will hand out, in order,
#   read only (`Owner::pending_effects`), because an `OwnedEffect` is moved,
#   never copied; the bench reads their identities, the tests of the runtime
#   their content. Its body is a call, so the linter does not report it. The
#   owner of the repository chose that read view on 24 November 2026
#   (record 0064).
field-leak mqttiumd_lab::bench::collector::Collector::lines
field-leak mqttiumd_lab::store::adapter::SimStore::store
shallow-module mqttiumd_contract
shallow-module mqttiumd_store_api
wide-directory crates/mqttiumd-contract/src/
wide-directory crates/mqttiumd-lab/src/bench/
wide-directory crates/mqttiumd-lab/tests/
wide-directory crates/mqttiumd-store-sqlite/tests/
long-file crates/mqttiumd-contract/src/effects.rs
long-file crates/mqttiumd-contract/src/opening.rs
long-file crates/mqttiumd-core/src/owner.rs
long-file crates/mqttiumd-core/src/owner/pubsub.rs
long-file crates/mqttiumd-core/src/owner/sessions.rs
long-file crates/mqttiumd-lab/src/semantic.rs
long-file crates/mqttiumd-lab/src/store/conformance.rs
long-file crates/mqttiumd-lab/src/store/durable.rs
long-file crates/mqttiumd-store-sqlite/src/lib.rs
long-file crates/mqttiumd-store-volatile/src/lib.rs
long-file crates/mqttiumd/src/codec.rs
long-file crates/mqttiumd/src/net.rs
long-file crates/mqttiumd/src/runtime.rs
long-file crates/mqttiumd/src/runtime_tests.rs
long-file crates/mqttiumd/src/writer.rs
